{
  "_id": "Ww5BR9eIXHDFRD61",
  "name": "Friends",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-swirl.webp",
  "folder": "uFpGvjgYK0DKq0KE",
  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You project a magical feeling of friendship at one creature you can see within range. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the &amp;Reference[charmed apply=false]{Charmed} condition for the duration. The save succeeds automatically if the target isn't a Humanoid, if you are in combat with it, or if you have already cast this spell on it in the last 24 hours.</p><p>The spell ends early if the target takes damage, or if you make an attack roll, deal damage, or force any creature to make a saving throw. Once the spell ends, the target realizes you Charmed it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-nPCMd7d4Kd188BZI\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The automatic successes (not a Humanoid, in combat with you, already targeted within 24 hours) and the early end are judged by the GM.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
